   "text": "Why a model? Emails and Slack are prose.\nCode then checks every quote is really in\nthe source, and every question is in the\ncatalog. Anything else is dropped.",
   "originalText": "Why a model? Emails and Slack are prose.\nCode then checks every quote is really in\nthe source, and every question is in the\ncatalog. Anything else is dropped.",
