   "text": "5  Planner\nCODE\n\nFor each requirement:\nready / open / blocked\n\nOne action per unsettled\nquestion, only where work\ncan start today\n\nRanked by answers unblocked\nOne message per person\nUpdates owed (from the ledger)",
