   "text": "Why it exists: knowing what is unsettled\nis a list of 47 problems. The planner says\nwho to message first and which customer\nanswers each item unblocks.\n\nExample: 'Elena: ask about Acme residency,\nunblocks 6. Fallback, providers and\ntransfers cannot move until this is settled.'",
